{
  "ALL_TEXT": "90 EXT. POLICE STATION - DAY \nOutside the station, VEDA and BHANU walk away, when they are \nstopped by a fast-walking INUMAYYA \nINUMAYYA \nSaar Saar aagu \nBHANU \nEnti? \nINUMAYYA \nPoddunninchi sukka padaka \nsachchipothunna. Mee pant jobbey lo \nuna ah sara packet naku isthara? \nBHANU looks at VEDA who gives him a disgusted look. \nINUMAYYA \nBaab baab emanukokunda ivvu, \nsaksham chepinapapaniki podhuninchi \nkusopettaru. \nVEDA and BHANU ask at once. \nVEDA \nPeru enti? \nPeru enti? \nBHANU \nINUMAYYA \nINUMAYYA \nVEDA sighs in relief. \nVEDA \nneetho patu saksham cheppina \ninkokadu evvarru... \nINUMAYYA \nAh! saaru nee kaalmoktha...mundhu \naa packet eivu cheptha. \nBHANU pulls out a liquor packet from his pocket and hands it \nover to INUMAYYA, who drinks it in no time. \nINUMAYYA \nANTHONY. Inkokati undha? \nVEDA \nMundhu cheppu ANTHONY ekkada \nuntaadu? ANTHONY evvaru? \nINUMAYYA \nOsmania hospital mortuary lo pani \nchesthaadu anta. \nVEDA nudges BHANU \nPadha ra \nVEDA \nINUMAYYA \nMari naa unko packet? \nVEDA and BHANU leave, not listening to INUMAYYA \nINUMAYYA \nInko packet isthey cheppe vaadini \nkadha...indhaka peddha saar toh \nmaatladaadu kadha vade ANTHONY ani. \nINUMAYYA peeps into the station. ANTHONY is signing off on a \nregister. \nCUT TO:",
